      <title>Resident Evil Fans Will Regret Driving Away Zach Cregger</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-09-12/resident-evil-fans-will-regret-driving-away-zach-cregger</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">b19502c1b88fc32a47ebc497</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 12:00:04 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>As the latest big-screen adaptation of the zombie video game series Resident Evil gears up for release next week, the film’s writer-director is dealing with a rabid horde of his own. While promoting the film, Zach Cregger has addressed the backlash his adaptation has received from fans over perceived creative liberties he’s taken with the franchise. In an interview with IGN, he admitted he was “naive” to assume fans would embrace an original story instead of a more straightforward adaptation. Re</description>
